    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/40698afe584b4c7c3291b2d8b4d907da.avif?t=1736516461\" width=411 height=123 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/7baf9f249cbb3135af92871613330fd5.webp?t=1736516461\" width=191 height=49 /></span><br>A Touhou Project fan-made STG, also a collab game with Vtuber Syrena.<br>There is only one stage in this game, and its length is about the same as Touhou Ex Stages. But there are four difficulties you can choose from.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/95e15cceef0ca5b37b3dfc4afd04935c.webp?t=1736516461\" width=191 height=49 /></span><br>Some day a random suspicious pink UFO showed up in Gensokyo.<br>This must be an incident!<br>Therefore Reimu and Marisa jumped in directly to attack the UFO, without knowing the fact that the owner of the UFO was Sirena, just an alien passing by.<br>Since the UFO was damaged, there is no more to say. With that, a spell card duel has begun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/b6f07137f47a033367a037ff66506af4.webp?t=1736516461\" width=191 height=49 /></span><br>Recreated UFO system from Touhou Undefined Fantastic Object, but there is only one type of color for the UFOs. You won't collect the wrong UFO by mistake again!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/b8cdcf0dbb31364d9f2ab92c2d36c7aa.webp?t=1736516461\" width=191 height=49 /></span><br>\u2605 2 main characters<br>\u2605 4 shot types<br>\u2605 4 difficulties<br>\u2605 A danmaku engine with better performance<br>\u2605 Steam Leaderboard and anti-cheat<br>\u2605 You can use auto dodging if you have Project Beril in your steam library",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/40698afe584b4c7c3291b2d8b4d907da.avif?t=1736516461\" width=411 height=123 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/7baf9f249cbb3135af92871613330fd5.webp?t=1736516461\" width=191 height=49 /></span><br>A Touhou Project fan-made STG, also a collab game with Vtuber Syrena.<br>There is only one stage in this game, and its length is about the same as Touhou Ex Stages. But there are four difficulties you can choose from.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/95e15cceef0ca5b37b3dfc4afd04935c.webp?t=1736516461\" width=191 height=49 /></span><br>Some day a random suspicious pink UFO showed up in Gensokyo.<br>This must be an incident!<br>Therefore Reimu and Marisa jumped in directly to attack the UFO, without knowing the fact that the owner of the UFO was Sirena, just an alien passing by.<br>Since the UFO was damaged, there is no more to say. With that, a spell card duel has begun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/b6f07137f47a033367a037ff66506af4.webp?t=1736516461\" width=191 height=49 /></span><br>Recreated UFO system from Touhou Undefined Fantastic Object, but there is only one type of color for the UFOs. You won't collect the wrong UFO by mistake again!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628190/extras/b8cdcf0dbb31364d9f2ab92c2d36c7aa.webp?t=1736516461\" width=191 height=49 /></span><br>\u2605 2 main characters<br>\u2605 4 shot types<br>\u2605 4 difficulties<br>\u2605 A danmaku engine with better performance<br>\u2605 Steam Leaderboard and anti-cheat<br>\u2605 You can use auto dodging if you have Project Beril in your steam library",
    "short_description": "A Touhou Project fan-made STG, also a collab game with Vtuber Syrena. Some day a random suspicious pink UFO showed up in Gensokyo. This must be an incident! As a result, Reimu and Marisa went on a journey to solve the incident.",
